      "Ability§Edicts of the King": {
        "text": "At the start of each battle round, select one effect until the start of the next battle round:\n**Memory:** Friendly VEILED CONCORD units within 6\" add 1 to Hit rolls.\n**Ascendancy:** Friendly VEILED CONCORD units within 6\" add 2\" to Move and add 2 to Advance and Charge rolls.\n**Protection:** Friendly VEILED CONCORD units within 6\", including this model, can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18\"."
      },
      "Ability§The King's Decree": {
        "text": "At the start of each battle round, select one enemy unit. Until the start of the next battle round, each time a friendly VEILED CONCORD model attacks that unit, re-roll the Wound roll and add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Sovereign Recall": {
        "text": "Each time a friendly unit is returned using Recall, it benefits from both Ancestral stances until the start of your next Command phase. Each time this model is selected as the Anchor for a Recall, reduce that Recall's cost by 1 RP, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Divine Vessel": {
        "text": "This model has Feel No Pain 5+. Each time this model destroys an enemy unit, it regains D3 lost wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Keeper of the Returning Paths": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, select one friendly ANCHOR unit within 12\". Until the start of your next Command phase, each Recall channelled through that unit costs 1 fewer RP, to a minimum of 1, and units returned through it add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls."
      },
      "Ability§Wisdom of Ages": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, roll one D6, adding 1 if a friendly PSYKER is within 6\". On a 4+, gain 1CP, subject to the normal limit on gaining additional CP."
      },
      "Ability§Memory Cannot Die": {
        "text": "The first time this model's unit is destroyed, do not treat this model as destroyed. At the end of the phase, set this model back up with 3 wounds remaining within 6\" of a friendly ANCHOR and more than 9\" horizontally from all enemy models. This is not Recall. If this model was leading a unit, only this model returns."
      },
      "Ability§Guardian of the Host": {
        "text": "Each time an attack is allocated to a friendly DAEMON unit within 6\", worsen the AP characteristic of that attack by 1, to a minimum of AP0."
      },
      "Ability§Unbroken Through Death": {
        "text": "Each time a friendly DAEMON unit within 12\" is destroyed, gain RP equal to half that unit's normal Recall cost, rounding up."
      },
      "Ability§Warden Eternal": {
        "text": "Subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of attacks allocated to this model, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§First Among the Returned": {
        "text": "Each time an enemy unit within 12\" is destroyed, gain 1 additional RP. If that enemy unit was destroyed by an attack made by this model, gain 2 additional RP instead."
      },
      "Ability§Perfection Through Conflict": {
        "text": "Each time this model destroys an enemy unit, select one bonus below that has not already been selected for this model. The bonus lasts for the rest of the battle:\n**Swiftness:** +2\" Move.\n**Might:** +1 Strength and +1 Damage to melee weapons.\n**Endurance:** +1 Toughness."
      },
      "Ability§Refusal to Fall": {
        "text": "The first time this model would be destroyed, roll one D6. On a 3+, it is not destroyed and remains in play with D3+3 wounds remaining."
      },
      "Ability§Command of the War Host": {
        "text": "Friendly VEILED CONCORD VEHICLE units within 9\" re-roll Hit rolls of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Mobile Recall Nexus": {
        "text": "Once per battle round, when a friendly VEHICLE unit within 12\" is selected as an Anchor, that unit does not become Channeling as a result of that Recall."
      },
      "Ability§Unyielding Command Chassis": {
        "text": "Subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of attacks allocated to this model, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Battlefield Authority": {
        "text": "Once per battle round, reduce the CP cost of one Stratagem that targets this model's unit by 1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Ancestral Command": {
        "text": "Once per battle round, at the start of any phase, this model's unit benefits from both Ancestral Guidance stances until the end of the phase."
      },
      "Ability§Master of the Returning Host": {
        "text": "Each time a friendly ANCHOR unit within 9\" channels a Recall, reduce that Recall's cost by 1 RP, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Empowered Return": {
        "text": "Each time a friendly unit is returned using Recall within 9\", add 1 to Hit rolls for that unit until the start of your next Command phase."
      },
      "Ability§Heavy Hunter": {
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, add 1 to Wound rolls for melee attacks made by models in that unit against MONSTER or VEHICLE units."
      },
      "Ability§Unyielding Assault": {
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, that unit can re-roll Charge rolls."
      },
      "Ability§Bulwark Commander": {
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have Feel No Pain 6+."
      },
      "Ability§Relentless Advance": {
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, that unit can shoot and charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Ability§Preserved Through Memory": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, select one friendly VEILED CONCORD unit within 6\" and roll D3+3. If that unit contains a wounded model, one wounded model regains that many lost wounds. Otherwise, if that unit is below Starting Strength, return one destroyed non-CHARACTER model with 1 wound remaining, then that model regains a number of lost wounds equal to the remaining amount rolled."
      },
      "Ability§Lessons of Ages Past": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, select one friendly VEILED CONCORD unit within 9\" and select Lethal Hits or Sustained Hits 1. Until the start of your next Command phase, weapons equipped by models in that unit gain the selected ability."
      },
      "Ability§Greater Presence": {
        "text": "Once per phase, each friendly DAEMON unit within 9\" can re-roll one Hit roll and one Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Perseverance Incarnate": {
        "text": "Once per battle round, when a friendly DAEMON unit within 9\" is destroyed, select one other friendly DAEMON unit within 9\". Until the start of your next Command phase, add 1 to Hit and Wound rolls for that unit."
      },
      "Ability§Gathering of the Returned": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, count friendly DAEMON units within 9\", including this model. Gain RP equal to half that number, rounding down, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Ascendant of the Ancestors": {
        "text": "Friendly VEILED CONCORD units within 6\" gain the following benefit based on your active Ancestral Guidance stance:\n**Assault:** Re-roll Wound rolls of 1.\n**Bulwark:** Subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of attacks allocated to those units, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Transcendent Predator": {
        "text": "Each time this model makes a melee attack against a unit below Starting Strength, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Predatory Momentum": {
        "text": "This unit can charge in a turn in which it Fell Back. If this unit made a Charge move this turn, add 1 to Wound rolls for its melee attacks."
      },
      "Ability§Defiant unto Death": {
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit is destroyed by a melee attack, roll one D6. On a 4+, if that model has not fought this phase, it can fight after the attacking model's unit has finished making its attacks, then it is removed."
      },
      "Ability§Voidplate Bulwark": {
        "text": "Each time an attack is allocated to a model in this unit, worsen the AP characteristic of that attack by 1, to a minimum of AP0."
      },
      "Ability§Crippling Impact": {
        "text": "If this unit scores one or more hits against an enemy unit with ranged attacks, until the end of your opponent's next turn subtract 2\" from that enemy unit's Move characteristic and worsen its Save characteristic by 1. Multiple instances do not stack."
      },
      "Ability§Bombardment Marking": {
        "text": "If this unit scores one or more hits against an enemy unit with ranged attacks, until the end of the turn that enemy unit cannot receive the Benefit of Cover against attacks made by other VEILED CONCORD units."
      },
      "Ability§Guides of the Returned": {
        "text": "Each time this unit channels a Recall, reduce that Recall's cost by 1 RP, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Lingering Presence": {
        "text": "If this unit controls an objective marker at the end of your Command phase, that objective marker remains under your control until your opponent controls it at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Ability§Remembered Weakness": {
        "text": "After this model finishes making ranged attacks against an enemy unit, until the end of your next turn unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ made by this model against that enemy unit are Critical Hits."
      },
      "Ability§Threat Identified": {
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack against a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit that has lost one or more wounds, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Through Adversity, Ascend": {
        "text": "While this model is below Starting Strength, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its melee weapons. While it is Below Half-strength, add 2 instead."
      },
      "Ability§Relentless Pursuit": {
        "text": "This model can Advance and charge. Each time an enemy unit Falls Back while within Engagement Range of this model, roll one D6 for each model in that enemy unit; for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 2 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Shelter of the Ancestors": {
        "text": "Friendly VEILED CONCORD units within 6\" have Feel No Pain 6+."
      },
      "Ability§Manifested Wisdom": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, select one friendly VEILED CONCORD unit within 9\" and one effect until the start of your next Command phase:\n**Ascend:** Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of weapons equipped by models in that unit.\n**Protect:** Each time an attack with Strength greater than that unit's Toughness targets that unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Dominion of the King": {
        "text": "Subtract 2\" from the Move characteristic of enemy units within 9\" and subtract 1 from their OC characteristic, to a minimum of 0."
      },
      "Ability§Claim Ground": {
        "text": "After deployment, select one objective marker. While this model is within range of that objective marker, its OC characteristic is 10, it has Feel No Pain 5+, and each time an enemy model also within range of that objective makes an attack against this model, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Predatory Convergence": {
        "text": "If this model's ranged attacks inflicted one or more wounds on an enemy unit this turn, add 1 to melee Hit rolls made by this model against that enemy unit for the rest of the turn."
      },
      "Ability§Coordinated Fire Control": {
        "text": "When both main weapon mounts target the same enemy unit, add 1 to Hit rolls made with those main weapons. When the two main weapon mounts target different enemy units, re-roll Hit rolls of 1 made with those main weapons."
      },
      "Ability§Heavy Target Acquisition": {
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack against a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit, re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Siege Dominance": {
        "text": "This model can shoot while within Engagement Range without the normal penalty. While this model is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, re-roll Wound rolls for attacks made by this model."
      },
      "Ability§Reinforced Warp Hull": {
        "text": "Each time an attack with Strength greater than this model's Toughness targets this model, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Guided Deployment": {
        "text": "Each time a unit disembarks from this TRANSPORT, that unit benefits from both Ancestral Guidance stances until the start of your next Command phase."
      },
      "Ability§Stabilized Return": {
        "text": "Each time a friendly unit is returned using Recall within 9\", until the start of your next Command phase add 1 to that unit's OC characteristic and models in it have Feel No Pain 5+."
      },
      "Ability§Warp Translation Matrix": {
        "text": "Once per battle round, when a friendly VEILED CONCORD unit within 9\" is selected to make a Normal Move, that unit can move through models and terrain features as though they were not there, but must end that move in a legal position."
      },
      "Ability§Progressive Targeting Matrix": {
        "text": "The Cataclysm Cannon, Annihilation Array and Riftstorm Battery are this model's primary weapons. Each time one of those weapons scores one or more hits against an enemy unit, that enemy unit becomes Target Locked until the end of the phase. Each time this model subsequently makes an attack against that enemy unit with a different weapon, add 1 to the Wound roll and that attack has Ignores Cover."
      },
      "Ability§Anchored War Engine": {
        "text": "While this model is within range of an objective marker you control, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of attacks allocated to it, to a minimum of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Relentless Engine": {
        "text": "This model can shoot and charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back."
      },
      "Ability§Shock Charge": {
        "text": "Once per phase, you can target this model with the Tank Shock Stratagem for 0CP, even if another unit from your army has already been targeted with that Stratagem this phase."
      },
      "Ability§Concord Wardens—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Each model selects one ranged weapon: Warp Rifle, Resonance Carbine or Warp Repeater; and one melee weapon: Warp Blade or Rift Talons. For every 5 models, one model can replace its ranged weapon with an Anchor Cannon."
      },
      "Ability§Ascendant Reavers—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Each model is equipped with a Rift Pistol and Warp Cleaver. For every 5 models, one model can replace its Warp Cleaver with a Void Maul."
      },
      "Ability§Veilguard—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Each model is equipped with a Warp Rifle and selects either a Heavy Warp Glaive or Void Maul."
      },
      "Ability§Sanctum Cataphracts—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Each model selects one ranged weapon: Warp Rifle, Resonance Carbine, Warp Repeater or Veilstorm Repeater; and one melee weapon: Heavy Warp Glaive or Void Maul. For every 5 models, one model can replace its ranged weapon with an Aether Lance or Riftbreaker."
      },
      "Ability§Exactor Cohort—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Each model selects either an Aether Lance or Riftbreaker and is equipped with a Rift Knife."
      },
      "Ability§Concord Praetor—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Equipped with Ascendant Rifle and Ascendant Blade. The rifle can be replaced by an Ascendant Carbine or Ascendant Pistol. The blade can be replaced by an Ascendant Maul."
      },
      "Ability§Veilblade Exemplar—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Equipped with Ascendant Pistol and selects either Ascendant Glaive or Veilblade Ascendant Maul."
      },
      "Ability§Sanctum Praetor—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "Equipped with Ascendant Heavy Rifle and selects either Sanctum Ascendant Glaive or Sanctum Ascendant Maul."
      },
      "Ability§Exactor Battle Tank—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "This model has two independent main weapon mounts. Each mount selects Suppression Cannon, Exactor Standard or Exactor Overcharged. It is also equipped with Side Repeater, Defensive Warp Projector and Armoured Hull."
      },
      "Ability§Siegebreaker Battle Tank—Wargear Options": {
        "text": "This model has two independent main weapon mounts. Each mount selects Siegebreaker Cannon or Rift Lance. It is also equipped with Repeater Battery, Close Defense Projector and Siegebreaker Hull."
      },
