      "Stratagem§The Anchor Endures": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit selects its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD unit selected as a target.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, subtract 1 from Wound rolls made against your unit. If your unit is Channeling, models in it also have Feel No Pain 5+ against those attacks."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ancestral Intercession": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD unit that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1]. If your unit has the DAEMON keyword, those weapons also gain [LETHAL HITS]."
      },
      "Stratagem§Borrowed Momentum": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD unit that has not been selected to move.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, add 2\" to its Move characteristic and add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls. If it has the DAEMON keyword, it can Advance and charge this turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Memory of Victory": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, against enemy units below Starting Strength, re-roll Hit rolls of 1 and improve the AP characteristic of attacks by 1. Against enemy units Below Half-strength, also re-roll Wound rolls of 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Step Through the Sanctuary": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD unit within 6\" of a friendly ANCHOR that has not moved this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove that unit from the battlefield and set it back up wholly within 6\" of a different friendly ANCHOR and more than 9\" horizontally from all enemy models. It counts as having made a Normal Move. If it has the DAEMON keyword, the destination range is 9\" instead of 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Death Is a Door": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a VEILED CONCORD unit is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That destroyed unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of your next Command phase, reduce that unit’s next Recall cost by 2 RP, to a minimum of 1 RP.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Each unit can only be targeted by this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Detachment§Host of Eternal Return": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 3
          }
        },
        "text": "**PERFECTED CHANNELING**\n\nWhen a friendly ANCHOR is selected to channel a Recall, you may take a Leadership test for that ANCHOR. If passed, reduce that Recall's cost by 1 RP (to a minimum of 1), that ANCHOR can shoot and declare a charge while Channeling (it still cannot make a Normal Move, Advance or Fall Back), and the returned unit re-rolls Hit rolls of 1 and Wound rolls of 1 until the start of your next Command phase. If failed, resolve the Recall normally, then that ANCHOR suffers D3 mortal wounds.\n\n**THE DEAD ANSWER EVERYWHERE**\n\nUp to twice per battle round, when you declare a Recall, after paying its normal RP cost you may select any friendly VEILED CONCORD unit instead of an ANCHOR. Set the returned unit up within 6\" of that selected unit and more than 9\" horizontally from enemy models. The selected unit does not become Channeling, and Perfected Channeling does not apply to that Recall.",
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§The Anchor Endures"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Ancestral Intercession"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Borrowed Momentum"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Memory of Victory"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Step Through the Sanctuary"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
