      "Enhancement§Voice Beyond Death": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Each time a unit is returned using Recall through the bearer, select one: until the start of your next Command phase that returned unit’s weapons gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1], or models in that returned unit have Feel No Pain 6+.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 25
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Keeper of the Open Path": {
        "text": "ANCHOR CHARACTER model only. Each time a unit is returned using Recall through the bearer, it can be set up within 9\" of the bearer instead of within 6\", while still more than 9\" horizontally from all enemy models.",
        "keywords": {
