      "Enhancement§Memory Made Flesh": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. The first time the bearer is returned using Recall, for the rest of the battle add 1 to its Wounds and Objective Control characteristics and add 1 to the Strength characteristic of its melee weapons.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Host of Eternal Return"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Memory Unforgotten": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Legion Beyond Death"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD DAEMON unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, re-roll Hit rolls of 1 and Wound rolls of 1 for attacks made by models in your unit. If your unit is below Starting Strength, re-roll all Hit rolls instead while still re-rolling Wound rolls of 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ascendant Surge": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Legion Beyond Death"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD DAEMON unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, add 2\" to Move, add 2 to Advance and Charge rolls, and the unit is eligible to charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Protection Incarnate": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Legion Beyond Death"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy selects targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD DAEMON unit selected as a target.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, if an attack’s Strength is greater than your unit’s Toughness, subtract 1 from its Wound roll; otherwise worsen that attack’s AP by 1, to a minimum of AP0."
      },
      "Stratagem§Perseverance Made Flesh": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Legion Beyond Death"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD DAEMON unit below Starting Strength.\n\n**EFFECT:** One wounded model in the unit regains D3+3 lost wounds. If there are no wounded models and the unit contains multiple models, return one destroyed non-CHARACTER model to the unit with D3 wounds remaining, not exceeding its Wounds characteristic."
      },
      "Stratagem§Through the Rift": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Legion Beyond Death"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD DAEMON unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in that unit can move through models and terrain as though they were not there, but must end the move in legal positions."
      },
      "Stratagem§Refuse the Final Death": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Legion Beyond Death"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit selects a VEILED CONCORD DAEMON unit as a target.\n\n**TARGET:** That DAEMON unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, each time a model in your unit that has not fought this phase is destroyed by a melee attack, roll one D6. On a 4+, after the attacking unit finishes its attacks, that destroyed model can fight, then it is removed.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** A model cannot also attack as a result of another rule triggered by that model being destroyed."
      },
      "Detachment§Legion Beyond Death": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 3
          }
        },
        "text": "**THE VEIL THICKENS**\n\nCount the number of friendly VEILED CONCORD DAEMON units on the battlefield. Apply the following cumulative benefits: 3+ units: add 1 to the OC characteristic of friendly VEILED CONCORD DAEMON models; 6+ units: add 1 to the Strength characteristic of their weapons; 9+ units: those models have Feel No Pain 6+.\n\n**SANCTUARY MADE MANIFEST**\n\nOnce per battle, at the start of a battle round, you can invoke the Sanctuary until the start of the next battle round. Each time a friendly VEILED CONCORD DAEMON model is destroyed during that time, before removing it, it may either shoot with one ranged weapon it is equipped with or fight with one melee weapon it is equipped with. A model cannot also attack as a result of another rule triggered by that model being destroyed.",
        "rules": {
