      "Enhancement§Mortal Transfiguration": {
        "text": "Non-DAEMON CHARACTER model only. The bearer gains the DAEMON keyword. If it does not already have an invulnerable save of 5+ or better, it gains a 5+ invulnerable save. Add 1 to its Objective Control characteristic.",
        "keywords": {
