      "Enhancement§Presence of the Sovereign": {
        "text": "DAEMON CHARACTER model only. Friendly VEILED CONCORD DAEMON units within 6\" of the bearer can re-roll Battle-shock tests and add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls.",
