      "Stratagem§Two Bodies, One Purpose": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord of Two Realms"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy selects a VEILED CONCORD unit as a target.\n\n**TARGET:** That unit and one friendly VEILED CONCORD unit of the opposite DAEMON status within 6\" of it.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, subtract 1 from Wound rolls against the targeted unit. Until the end of the phase, add 1 to Hit rolls made by the supporting unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Strike in Concert": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord of Two Realms"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly DAEMON unit and one friendly non-DAEMON unit within 6\" of each other.\n\n**EFFECT:** If both selected units attack the same enemy unit this phase, the first selected unit to attack gains [LETHAL HITS] for those attacks and the second gains [SUSTAINED HITS 1]."
      },
      "Stratagem§Through One Another": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord of Two Realms"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly DAEMON or non-DAEMON unit and one friendly VEILED CONCORD unit of the opposite DAEMON status anywhere on the battlefield.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove the first unit from the battlefield and set it back up wholly within 6\" of the second unit and more than 9\" horizontally from all enemy models. It counts as having made a Normal Move. If the two units are Linked this phase, the setup range is 9\" instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Answer as One": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord of Two Realms"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** The friendly unit that was charged and one friendly unit of the opposite DAEMON status within 6\" of it that is not within Engagement Range.\n\n**EFFECT:** The supporting unit can make an Intervention move of up to 6\". It can enter Engagement Range of the charging enemy unit but no other enemy unit, and must end the move closer to the first friendly unit. Until the end of the turn, both selected units add 1 to melee Hit rolls against that charging enemy unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Two Natures, One Soul": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord of Two Realms"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly DAEMON unit and one friendly non-DAEMON unit within 6\" of each other.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of your next Command phase, the non-DAEMON unit gains a 5+ invulnerable save, or improves an existing invulnerable save by 1 to a maximum of 4+; the DAEMON unit gains +1 OC; and both units can re-roll Battle-shock tests. If the two units are Linked during a Shooting or Fight phase this turn, both also have Feel No Pain 6+ until the end of that phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§One Falls, the Other Rises": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord of Two Realms"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a VEILED CONCORD DAEMON or non-DAEMON unit is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly VEILED CONCORD unit of the opposite DAEMON status within 9\" of the destroyed unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of your next turn, add 1 to Hit rolls, add 1 to Wound rolls, and add 1 to the target unit’s OC characteristic. If the destroyed unit was the target’s Linked partner this phase, also add 2\" to the target’s Move characteristic."
      },
      "Detachment§Concord of Two Realms": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 3
          }
        },
        "text": "**RECIPROCAL ASCENDANCE**\n\nWhile a friendly non-DAEMON VEILED CONCORD unit is within 6\" of one or more friendly DAEMON units, add 1 to Hit rolls made by models in that non-DAEMON unit and add 1 to its models’ OC. Each time a friendly DAEMON unit destroys an enemy unit, until the start of your next Command phase add 1 to Wound rolls made by friendly non-DAEMON VEILED CONCORD units within 12\" of that DAEMON unit.\n\n**SOULS IN CONCERT**\n\nAt the start of your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, you can form any number of Links. Each Link consists of one friendly DAEMON unit and one friendly non-DAEMON VEILED CONCORD unit within 6\" of each other; a unit can only be part of one Link per phase. If one unit in a Link scores a Critical Hit, until the end of the phase add 1 to the Strength characteristic of weapons equipped by models in its partner unit. If one unit in a Link scores a Critical Wound, until the end of the phase improve the AP characteristic of attacks made by models in its partner unit by 1.",
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
