      "Enhancement§Sovereign Standard": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. While the bearer’s unit is within your Dominion, add 1 to its OC. If the bearer’s unit controls an objective marker at the end of your Command phase, that objective marker remains under your control until your opponent controls it at the end of a phase.",
        "keywords": {
