      "Enhancement§Writ of Exclusion": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Enemy units cannot be set up on the battlefield from Reserves within 12\" of the bearer. In addition, while an enemy unit is both within 6\" of the bearer and within your Dominion, subtract 1 from that unit’s OC, to a minimum of 0.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Sovereign Dominion"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Edict of the Living Throne": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. In your Command phase, select one friendly VEILED CONCORD unit within 9\" of the bearer and within your Dominion. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit benefits from both Ancestral Assault and Ancestral Bulwark.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Sovereign Dominion"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 30
          }
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Cross-Fire Protocol": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord Battle Cohort"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit that has not been selected to shoot this phase, and one enemy unit already targeted by another friendly unit this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, improve the AP characteristic of attacks made by your unit against that enemy by 1 and re-roll Wound rolls of 1. If that enemy is already affected by Coordinated Offensive, also add 1 to Wound rolls."
      },
      "Stratagem§Advance Under Cover": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord Battle Cohort"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, add 3\" to its Move characteristic and ranged weapons equipped by models in it gain [ASSAULT]. If the unit ends its move within range of an objective marker, until the start of your next Movement phase subtract 1 from Hit rolls for ranged attacks that target it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hold the Line": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord Battle Cohort"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
