            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy selects a VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit as a target.\n\n**TARGET:** That INFANTRY unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, subtract 1 from Hit rolls against your unit. If your unit is within range of an objective marker you control, also subtract 1 from Wound rolls against it. If your unit is Below Half-strength, models in it also have Feel No Pain 6+ against those attacks."
      },
      "Stratagem§Target of Opportunity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord Battle Cohort"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit attacking an enemy unit that has already lost one or more wounds or models this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ are Critical Hits. If Coordinated Offensive would give your unit either [LETHAL HITS] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1], it gains both instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Reform the Line": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord Battle Cohort"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent's Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit that is not within Engagement Range.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal Move of up to 6\" and can move through friendly INFANTRY models while doing so. If it ends that move within range of an objective marker, add 1 to its OC until the start of your next Command phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Disciplined Retaliation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Concord Battle Cohort"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit finishes making ranged attacks.\n\n**TARGET:** One surviving VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit that was targeted by those attacks and is eligible to shoot.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can immediately shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but can only target that enemy unit. If your unit lost one or more models to those attacks, improve the AP characteristic of those attacks by 1.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Once per battle round."
      },
      "Detachment§Concord Battle Cohort": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**COORDINATED OFFENSIVE**\n\nAfter a friendly VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit finishes making its ranged attacks against an enemy unit, until the end of the turn each other friendly VEILED CONCORD unit that targets that same enemy can choose one of the following for those attacks: [LETHAL HITS] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1].\n\n**MOMENTUM OF VICTORY**\n\nEach time a friendly VEILED CONCORD unit destroys an enemy unit in the Shooting phase or Fight phase, select one friendly VEILED CONCORD INFANTRY unit within 12\" of that friendly unit. Until the end of the phase, add 1 to Wound rolls made by that selected unit and its attacks have [IGNORES COVER]. A unit can only be selected for this ability once per phase.",
        "rules": {
