      "Stratagem§Override Protocols": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, that unit benefits from both Colossus Protocols."
      },
      "Stratagem§Maximum Output": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select up to two ranged weapon profiles equipped by models in your unit. Until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of those profiles, or add 1 to the result for a random Attacks characteristic, and improve their AP by 1. If both selected profiles are fired, after the unit finishes shooting roll one D6; on a 1, the unit suffers D3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Colossal Impact": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, just after a VEILED CONCORD MONSTER or VEHICLE unit ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** That unit and one enemy unit within Engagement Range of it.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll a number of D6 equal to one-third of your unit’s Toughness characteristic, rounding up. For each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound, to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds; if your unit is TITANIC, the maximum is 8 instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unyielding Frame": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit selects a VEILED CONCORD MONSTER or VEHICLE unit as a target.\n\n**TARGET:** That MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of attacks allocated to your unit, to a minimum of 1. If an attack’s Strength is greater than your unit’s Toughness, also subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Crush Through": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** During its move, models in your unit can move through enemy INFANTRY or BEAST models and terrain features up to 4\" in height as though they were not there, but must end in legal positions. After moving, select one enemy unit moved across and roll one D6 for every 5 wounds your unit has remaining, rounding up; for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound, to a maximum of 4."
      },
      "Stratagem§Still Functional": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a VEILED CONCORD MONSTER or VEHICLE model is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That destroyed model.\n\n**EFFECT:** Before removing it, it can either shoot with all ranged weapons it is equipped with or fight. Then remove it.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Each model can only be targeted by this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Detachment§Colossus Warhost": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**COLOSSUS PROTOCOLS**\n\nIn your Command phase, each friendly VEILED CONCORD MONSTER and VEHICLE unit selects one Protocol to benefit from until the start of your next Command phase.\n\n**Targeting Protocol:** Each time this unit is selected to shoot or fight, for each weapon profile used by this unit during that activation you can re-roll one Hit roll and one Wound roll made for that weapon profile. In addition, ignore modifiers to Hit rolls and to this unit’s Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics.\n\n**Bulwark Advance:** Add 2 to this unit’s OC, subtract 1 from Hit rolls for attacks that target it, add 2\" to its Move characteristic, and add 2 to Advance and Charge rolls made for it.",
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
