            "failState": "error"
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§War-Mind Interface": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Friendly VEILED CONCORD MONSTER and VEHICLE units within 6\" of the bearer can re-roll Battle-shock tests. Once per phase, select one such unit; that unit can re-roll one Hit roll, one Wound roll, and one Damage roll during that phase.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 25
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Engine of Ruin": {
        "text": "MONSTER or VEHICLE CHARACTER model only. Each time the bearer destroys an enemy unit, select one unclaimed permanent upgrade: **Predator:** add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the bearer’s melee weapons; **Artillery Mind:** improve the Ballistic Skill of its ranged weapons by 1; **Unyielding:** add 1 to its Toughness characteristic.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Colossus Warhost"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 25
          }
        },
        "rules": {
