        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. While the bearer is leading SANCTUM CATAPHRACTS, improve the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit by 1. Once per battle round, when an attack is allocated to a model in that unit, you can change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 0.",
