      "Enhancement§Keeper of the Last Gate": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Once per battle, at the start of any phase, the bearer can invoke this ability. Until the end of the phase, models in the bearer’s unit have Feel No Pain 4+, and enemy models cannot re-roll Hit rolls or Wound rolls against the bearer’s unit.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Sanctum Phalanx"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 30
          }
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Suppressive Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after an Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit finishes shooting.\n\n**TARGET:** One enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one effect to last until the start of your next Command phase: that enemy cannot Advance; subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for it; or subtract 1 from its OC, to a minimum of 0. If it lost one or more wounds from those attacks, select two different effects instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Counter-Battery Solution": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit finishes making ranged attacks.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit within range of that enemy and not within Engagement Range.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one ranged weapon profile equipped by models in your unit. Models equipped with that profile can immediately shoot the attacking enemy unit using only that weapon. Weapons with [INDIRECT FIRE] do not require visibility for this attack. If the enemy unit used one or more Indirect Fire weapons this phase, add 1 to Hit rolls for these attacks."
      },
      "Stratagem§Shoot and Displace": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after an Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit finishes shooting.\n\n**TARGET:** That unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** It can make a Normal Move of up to 6\". It is not eligible to charge this turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Breaching Munitions": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, against MONSTER, VEHICLE or FORTIFICATION units, Critical Wounds improve AP by 1 and add 1 to Damage. If an attack already has AP-4 or better, it gains [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] on a Critical Wound instead of receiving the additional AP."
      },
      "Stratagem§Interdiction Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal Move, Advance or Fall Back.\n\n**TARGET:** One eligible Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit within range of that enemy and not within Engagement Range.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one ranged weapon profile equipped by models in your unit. Models equipped with that profile can immediately shoot the moving enemy using only that weapon. If one or more hits are scored, until the end of the turn subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that enemy, subtract 1 from its OC, and it cannot receive bonuses to Charge rolls."
      },
      "Stratagem§Zone Denial Barrage": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your opponent's Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one objective marker within 36\" of your unit. Until the end of the turn, the area within 6\" horizontally of that objective is a Denial Zone. The first time each enemy unit ends a Normal Move, Advance or Fall Back in that zone this turn, it must take a Battle-shock test. If failed, it suffers D3 mortal wounds and cannot declare a charge this turn. Enemy units within the zone have -1 OC, to a minimum of 0."
      },
      "Detachment§Exactor Batteries": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**PREPARED FIRING POSITIONS**\n\nAt the start of your Shooting phase, each friendly Exactor Cohort and Dominion Batteries unit selects one doctrine to use until the end of the phase.\n\n**Focused Fire:** Add 6\" to the Range characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit, and attacks made with those weapons ignore modifiers to Hit rolls and Ballistic Skill.\n\n**Saturation Fire:** Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit; for a random Attacks characteristic, add 1 to the result instead.",
        "rules": {
