      "Enhancement§Master of Suppression": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. While the bearer is leading an Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit, after that unit scores one or more ranged hits against an enemy, select one until the start of your next Command phase: that enemy cannot Advance; subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for it; or subtract 1 from its OC, to a minimum of 0. If that enemy is also affected by Crippling Impact or Bombardment Marking, select two different effects instead.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 15
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Registered Kill-Zone": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. After deployment, select one objective marker. While an enemy unit is within 6\" of that objective marker, ranged attacks made by the bearer’s unit against it have [IGNORES COVER], and Critical Wounds improve AP by 1 and add 1 to Damage.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 15
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Munitions Savant": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. At the start of your Shooting phase, select one ranged weapon profile equipped by models in the bearer’s unit and one ammunition type until the end of the phase: **Penetrator:** that profile gains [ANTI-MONSTER 4+] and [ANTI-VEHICLE 4+]; **Disruption:** on a Critical Wound, the target cannot use abilities that reduce the Damage of that attack; **Execution:** that profile gains [PRECISION], and each Critical Hit scores one additional hit.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Architect of Annihilation": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Once per battle round, at the start of your Shooting phase, select one friendly Exactor Cohort or Dominion Batteries unit within 9\" of the bearer. Until the end of the phase, that unit benefits from both Prepared Firing Positions doctrines.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Exactor Batteries"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 25
          }
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Witness Their Valour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a friendly non-CHARACTER unit completes a Deed.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER within 12\" of that unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** The CHARACTER gains the corresponding Deed even if it is outside the normal 9\" witness range. If it already benefits from that Deed, add 1 to its OC until the end of the turn instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Challenge the Worthy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER unit attacking an enemy CHARACTER, MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, attacks made by your CHARACTER have [PRECISION] where applicable, improve AP by 1, and Critical Wounds add 1 to Damage. If the CHARACTER is benefiting from Slay the Foe, unmodified Wound rolls of 5+ are Critical Wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Heroes Do Not Yield": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy selects a VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER unit as a target.\n\n**TARGET:** That CHARACTER unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, subtract 1 from Hit rolls against your unit. If it is benefiting from Endure the Trial, also subtract 1 from Wound rolls. If it is not leading a unit, models in it also have Feel No Pain 5+ against those attacks."
      },
      "Stratagem§Lead from the Front": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, add 2 to Charge rolls made for your unit and it is eligible to charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back. If a friendly non-CHARACTER unit within 6\" already completed a charge this phase, your unit can re-roll its Charge roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Legend Inspires Legend": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER with at least one Deed and one friendly non-CHARACTER unit within 9\".\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, the non-CHARACTER unit gains benefits based on the CHARACTER’s Deeds: **Slay the Foe:** re-roll Wound rolls of 1; **Claim the Field:** improve AP by 1; **Endure the Trial:** models have Feel No Pain 6+. If the CHARACTER has all three Deeds, the non-CHARACTER unit gains all three benefits."
      },
      "Stratagem§A Deed for the Ages": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, it counts as benefiting from all three Deeds, add 1 to Hit rolls made by it, and add 1 to its OC. If it destroys an enemy unit this phase, gain 1CP, subject to the normal limit on gaining additional CP.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Once per battle round."
      },
      "Detachment§Deeds of Ascendancy": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**DEEDS WORTH REMEMBERING**\n\nWhenever a friendly non-CHARACTER VEILED CONCORD unit within 9\" of one or more friendly VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER units completes one of the Deeds below, each such CHARACTER can gain the corresponding benefit. Each CHARACTER can gain each Deed benefit no more than once per turn, and multiple instances of the same Deed benefit are not cumulative.\n\n**Slay the Foe:** When the non-CHARACTER unit destroys an enemy unit, add 1 to Wound rolls made by the witnessing CHARACTER until the end of the turn.\n\n**Claim the Field:** When the non-CHARACTER unit takes control of an objective marker that it did not control at the start of the phase, improve the AP characteristic of attacks made by the witnessing CHARACTER by 1 until the end of the turn.\n\n**Endure the Trial:** If the non-CHARACTER unit survives an enemy phase while Below Half-strength, models in the witnessing CHARACTER unit have Feel No Pain 5+ until the end of your next turn.",
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
