      "Enhancement§Living Legend": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Increase this bearer’s witness range for Deeds Worth Remembering to 12\". The first Deed benefit the bearer gains in each battle round lasts until the start of your next Command phase instead of its normal duration.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Champion of the Sovereign": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Each time the bearer attacks a CHARACTER, MONSTER or VEHICLE unit, re-roll Hit rolls of 1 and Wound rolls of 1. If the bearer is currently benefiting from two or more different Deeds, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of its attacks.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Legacy Incarnate": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Once per battle round, just after a friendly non-CHARACTER unit within 9\" completes a Deed, select one different friendly non-CHARACTER unit within 9\". Until the end of the turn, add 1 to that unit’s OC and it can re-roll Advance and Charge rolls.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 15
          }
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Worthy of Remembrance": {
        "text": "VEILED CONCORD CHARACTER model only. Once per battle, at the start of any phase, until the end of the phase the bearer counts as benefiting from all three Deeds. If it was already benefiting from all three when this ability was used, instead also add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its melee weapons and add 1 to the Damage characteristic of all its weapons for that phase.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Deeds of Ascendancy"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 25
          }
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§God-Engine Overdrive": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "God-Engines of the Concord"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD TITANIC unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, add 3\" to its Move characteristic, it can Advance and shoot, and it can move through non-TITANIC models as though they were not there. If it ends a Normal Move or Advance within range of an objective marker, add 2 to its OC until the start of your next Command phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Titanic Counterfire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "God-Engines of the Concord"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit finishes making ranged attacks against a VEILED CONCORD TITANIC unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That surviving TITANIC unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** It can immediately shoot the attacking enemy unit with one ranged weapon profile it is equipped with. If it lost 5 or more wounds from those attacks, it can instead shoot with two different ranged weapon profiles."
      },
      "Stratagem§Impossible to Silence": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "God-Engines of the Concord"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD TITANIC unit below Starting Strength.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ignore modifiers to its Hit rolls, Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill, and ignore any penalties caused by being damaged. If it is Below Half-strength, also add 1 to Wound rolls made by it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Earth-Shaking Impact": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "God-Engines of the Concord"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, just after a VEILED CONCORD TITANIC unit completes a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** One enemy unit within Engagement Range of it.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, subtract 1 from that enemy unit’s OC for every 5 wounds your TITANIC model has remaining, to a maximum penalty of 4. That enemy unit cannot Fall Back unless it passes a Leadership test."
      },
      "Stratagem§Reactor Bulwark": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "God-Engines of the Concord"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy selects a VEILED CONCORD TITANIC unit as a target.\n\n**TARGET:** That TITANIC unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, against attacks whose Strength is greater than your unit’s Toughness, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save. Against all other attacks, worsen AP by 1, to a minimum of AP0."
      },
      "Stratagem§King's Engine Unbroken": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "God-Engines of the Concord"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a VEILED CONCORD TITANIC model is destroyed and after resolving any rules that allow that model to attack before removal.\n\n**TARGET:** That destroyed model.\n\n**EFFECT:** After removing the model, place a Sovereign Core marker as close as possible to the centre of its former position. Until the end of your next Command phase, that marker counts as a friendly ANCHOR only for returning that destroyed model using Recall. If that model is returned through the Core, reduce its Recall cost by 2 RP, to a minimum of 1 RP, and set it up within 6\" of the Core and more than 9\" horizontally from all enemy models. Remove the Core after that Recall resolves or at the end of your next Command phase.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Each model can only be targeted by this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Detachment§God-Engines of the Concord": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**RELENTLESS GOD-ENGINES:** Friendly VEILED CONCORD TITANIC units can shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which they Fell Back.\n\n**TITANIC PRESENCE:** While a friendly VEILED CONCORD TITANIC model is within range of an objective marker, double its OC characteristic.\n\n**TITANIC BULWARK:** Each time an attack targets a friendly VEILED CONCORD TITANIC unit, if that attack’s Strength is greater than the unit’s Toughness, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.",
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
