      "Enhancement§Sovereign Reactor": {
        "text": "Non-EPIC HERO TITANIC unit only. At the start of each battle round, select one Reactor Mode until the start of the next battle round: **Weapon Surge:** select one ranged or melee weapon equipped by the bearer; add 1 to its Attacks characteristic, or add 1 to the result if it has a random Attacks characteristic. **Motive Surge:** add 3\" to the bearer’s Move characteristic and add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls. **Shield Surge:** the bearer has Feel No Pain 6+.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "God-Engines of the Concord"
          ],
