      "Enhancement§Throne-Bound Targeting Engine": {
        "text": "Non-EPIC HERO TITANIC unit only. At the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit visible to the bearer. Until the end of the phase, ranged attacks made by the bearer against that enemy have [IGNORES COVER], re-roll Damage rolls of 1, and ignore modifiers to Hit rolls and Ballistic Skill.",
