      "Enhancement§Warp-Step Actuators": {
        "text": "Non-EPIC HERO TITANIC unit only. When the bearer makes a Normal Move, Advance or Fall Back, it can move through models and terrain features as though they were not there. It cannot end that move within Engagement Range unless it could normally do so, and must end in a legal position.",
