      "Stratagem§Veil-Sight": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Conclave of the Veil"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly VEILED CONCORD unit within 9\" of a friendly VEILED CONCORD PSYKER unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged attacks made by models in your unit have [IGNORES COVER] and ignore modifiers to their Hit rolls and Ballistic Skill."
      },
      "Stratagem§Shared Consciousness": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Conclave of the Veil"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly VEILED CONCORD PSYKER unit and one other friendly VEILED CONCORD unit within 9\" of it.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of your next Command phase, the second unit can use the PSYKER unit’s Leadership characteristic and add 1 to its OC. If the second unit has been returned using Recall this battle, both selected units can also re-roll Battle-shock tests."
      },
      "Stratagem§Psychic Bastion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Conclave of the Veil"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit selects a friendly VEILED CONCORD PSYKER unit as a target.\n\n**TARGET:** That PSYKER unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit finishes making its attacks, subtract 1 from Hit rolls against your unit and models in it have Feel No Pain 5+ against mortal wounds and Psychic attacks. If your unit is currently Channeling, models in it instead have Feel No Pain 5+ against all attacks from that enemy unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Return Through Thought": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Conclave of the Veil"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase, when a destroyed VEILED CONCORD unit is selected to be returned through a PSYKER Anchor.\n\n**TARGET:** That destroyed unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When that Recall resolves, the returned unit can be set up wholly within 9\" of its Anchor instead of within 6\", while still more than 9\" horizontally from all enemy models. Until the end of the turn, that returned unit ignores modifiers to Advance and Charge rolls."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ancestral Surge": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Conclave of the Veil"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One VEILED CONCORD unit that was returned using Recall this turn.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one until the end of the phase: **Remembered Precision:** unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ are Critical Hits. **Remembered Strength:** re-roll Wound rolls of 1 and add 1 to the Strength characteristic of weapons equipped by models in the unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Mind Beyond Death": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Veiled Concord",
            "Conclave of the Veil"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a friendly VEILED CONCORD PSYKER unit is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That destroyed PSYKER unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** After removing it, place a Psychic Echo marker as close as possible to the centre of its former position. Until the end of your next Command phase, that marker counts as a friendly PSYKER ANCHOR for the purposes of Recall and this Detachment’s rules. It can channel up to two Recalls during that Command phase. Remove the marker after the second Recall resolves or at the end of your next Command phase.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Each unit can only be targeted by this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Detachment§Conclave of the Veil": {
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**LIVING CONDUITS**\n\nEach friendly VEILED CONCORD PSYKER unit can be selected as the Anchor for up to two Recalls in your Command phase instead of one. A PSYKER selected for one or two Recalls this way becomes Channeling only once.\n\nEach time a friendly unit is returned using Recall through a PSYKER Anchor, until the start of your next Command phase that returned unit can re-roll Advance and Charge rolls and models in it have Feel No Pain 6+.",
